<title>USA: RDO Equipment acquires Deere dealership.</title>
<headline>RDO Equipment acquires Deere dealership.</headline>
<dateline>FARGO, N.D. 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>RDO Equipment Co said Monday it acquired Bergstedt Implement Inc, a Deere &amp; Co agricultural dealership in Hazen, N.D., for an undisclosed amount.</p>
<p>The dealership had $2 million in revenues for the year ended December 31, RDO said.</p>
<p>-- Reuter Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
